messages.content:
Create an 8-beat story arc from the source and preserve every explicit source action in order.

When the source says "the majority of the film is X":
- allocate a contiguous emphasized narrative sequence of at least 5 of the 8 beats;
- these are beats devoted to the X conflict/process, not necessarily five literal repetitions of verb X;
- immediate preparation entering X, enemy attacks/setbacks within X, weapon transitions, continued fighting, the final kill, and immediate aftermath/resolution may all belong to that sequence;
- there may be at most 3 beats total outside that emphasized sequence;
- do not compress distinct earlier setup stages just to create literal X actions;
- when needed, put the final X result and immediate resolution in the same final sequence beat.

Use varied concrete events inside the emphasized sequence rather than mechanically repeating "kills more".
Return JSON only with {"beats":[{"beat_number":1,"event":"..."}]}.

